              "type": "text",
              "text": "Molly is paid $19.50 an hour and gets paid a bonus of $65 each week.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "One week she earned $786.50.",
              "marks": []
