    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "37 hours.",
      "worked": "Let $n$ be the number of hours Molly worked.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\n19.5n + 65 &= 786.5 \\\\\n19.5n &= 721.5 \\\\\nn &= 37\n\\end{align*}$$\n\nMolly worked 37 hours.\n\nCheck: $19.5(37)+65=786.5$.",
